======================================================================
SITE SIMULATIONS
======================================================================

--- Iceland/Norway (high-latitude deep-water) ---
  ECCO  : MLD=200.0m  Kz=2.5e-05m2/s  -> w_mix=0.00180m/hr  (deep MLD, moderate Kz)
  CESM2 : MLD=280.0m  Kz=3.5e-05m2/s  -> w_mix=0.00252m/hr  (KPP-overdeepened MLD, ~30% deeper)

--- Oman (Indian Ocean upwelling — extreme) ---
  ECCO  : MLD= 25.0m  Kz=1.0e-05m2/s  -> w_mix=0.00072m/hr  (thin upwelling MLD, weak interior Kz)
  CESM2 : MLD= 55.0m  Kz=4.0e-05m2/s  -> w_mix=0.00288m/hr  (subductive export of alkaline plume)

--- Brazil (subtropical thin-MLD outlier) ---
  ECCO  : MLD= 18.0m  Kz=2.0e-05m2/s  -> w_mix=0.00144m/hr  (very thin stratified MLD)
  CESM2 : MLD= 22.0m  Kz=2.5e-05m2/s  -> w_mix=0.00180m/hr  (slightly deeper but still thin MLD)

--- Japan/Kuroshio (exceptional site) ---
  ECCO  : MLD= 85.0m  Kz=3.5e-05m2/s  -> w_mix=0.00252m/hr  (mode-water deep MLD, strong mixing)
  CESM2 : MLD= 65.0m  Kz=2.0e-05m2/s  -> w_mix=0.00144m/hr  (shallower effective MLD, weaker export)

